---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout includeGallery>
    <div class="fullscreen-content">
        <div class="content">
            <div class="heading">
                <span class="title">about me.</span>
                <span class="subtext">who even is this guy</span>
            </div>
                <video class="me-vid" width="640" height="360" autoplay muted playsinline loop>
                    <source src="/assets/photogallery/working.webm" type="video/webm">
                    <source src="/assets/photogallery/working.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                </video>
            <p class="spaced-text">Hi! I'm <b>Connor</b>, and am a student at <b>new york university</b> studying <b>computer science.</b></p>

            <p>During my 4 years at NYU, I plan to make the most out of my time here. That means: excelling in schoolwork, meeting and talking to cracked
                 developers, making projects with founders and creators, and creating art through photography and videography. I aim to become a technically and aesthetically driven
                 developer, and to make applications that solve problems that people are actively facing.
            </p>
            <p>
                I haven't found out where exactly I want to contribute to in the field of computer science, but I've nonetheless found the
                journey to be difficult yet rewarding. From learning to sort and clean datasets to building this website, I've
                learned about so many different applications of algorithms and computer programs, inspiring me to embark on my own
                projects and programming endeavors.
            </p>
            <p>
                Feel free to contact me to talk about anything cs or photo/film related! I'd love to meet and collaborate with new people!
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
